      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHISKY BENT (2) was well fancied last time on the strength of the win two back but could only manage third (23.06) at Maitland. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Expected to feature in the finish again. DURAN QUEEN (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by a neck at this track in a handy 23.14 beating RHONDA FULL DAY. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from five starts. Leading player again. OCCULENT (7) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start eighth (30.80) at Wentworth Park. Has a good record here including three wins. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Cannot be taken lightly. LET'S TROT WILL (8) can play a role in the finish without surprising.",
